<h2 class="k-h k-h1" data-num="1" id="Blocks" data-k-anchor="Blocks"><span class="k-num" data-word="Chapter">1</span>Blocks</h2>
<div class="k-plan">
<div class="k-plan-head">In this chapter</div>
<ul class="k-plan-list">
<li>define a limit</li>
<li>prove a theorem</li>
<li>solve an example</li></ul></div>
<div class="k-box k-def"><span class="k-label">Definition 1.1 (limit).</span> A sequence <math><msub><mi>𝑥</mi><mi>𝑛</mi></msub></math> converges to <math><mi>𝑎</mi></math> if <math><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝑥</mi><mi>𝑛</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>𝑎</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</div>
<div class="k-box k-thm"><span class="k-label">Theorem 1.2.</span> Every convergent sequence is bounded.</div>
<div class="k-proof"><span class="k-proof-head">Why this holds.</span> Take <math><mi>𝜀</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. <span class="k-qed">∎</span></div>
<div class="k-box k-example"><span class="k-label">Example 1.1 (squeeze).</span> <span class="k-step">Step 1. Estimate.</span> <math><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>𝑛</mi></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.16666666666666666em">sin</mo><mi>𝑛</mi></mrow><mi>𝑛</mi></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>𝑛</mi></mfrac></math>.
<div class="k-answer"><span class="k-answer-label">Answer:</span> <math><mn>0</mn></math></div></div>
<div class="k-box k-remark"><span class="k-label">Remark.</span> A remark.</div>
<div class="k-box k-pitfall"><span class="k-label">Common mistake.</span> A pitfall.</div>
<div class="k-box k-idea"><span class="k-label">Idea.</span> An idea.</div>
<div class="k-box k-algo"><span class="k-label">Algorithm.</span> An algorithm.</div>
<table class="k-table k-pitfalls">
<thead>
<tr><th class="k-bad">✗ Mistake</th><th class="k-good">✓ How to avoid</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>dividing by zero</td><td>check the denominator</td></tr></tbody></table>
<div class="k-summary">
<div class="k-summary-head">Key points</div>
<ol class="k-summary-list">
<li>limits</li>
<li>bounds</li></ol></div>
<div class="k-quiz">
<div class="k-quiz-head">Check yourself</div>
<ol class="k-quiz-list">
<li>Is <math><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>𝑛</mi></mfrac></math> bounded?</li></ol>
<details class="k-quiz-answers"><summary>Answers</summary>
<ol class="k-quiz-list">
<li>Yes.</li></ol></details></div>
